# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ArkBox / 方舟压包
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Rust / Tauri 构建产物 -------------------------------------------------
# 6.9G，含 release 二进制、LTO 中间产物、bundle/dmg 与 bundle/macos
src-tauri/target/

# Tauri 自动生成的配置 schema，每次 build 会重写
src-tauri/gen/schemas/

# --- Node / 前端 -----------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local
.vite/
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
vite.config.js.timestamp-*

# --- macOS 原生扩展的构建产物 ----------------------------------------------
# 源码（generate.c / findersync.m / 两个 Info.plist / build.sh）保留，
# 编译出来的 bundle 不入库
quicklook/ArkBoxQL/ArkBoxQL.qlgenerator/
quicklook/ArkBoxQL/build/
findersync/ArkBoxFSE.appex/
**/DerivedData/
**/*.xcuserdata
**/*.xcworkspace

# --- 打包与签名产物 --------------------------------------------------------
*.dmg
*.app/
*.pkg

# 签名证书与密钥：一旦误提交就必须吊销重签，务必挡住
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
*.key
*.pem

# --- 日志与运行时 ----------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- 系统与编辑器 ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# --- 环境变量 --------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- 本地会话数据 ----------------------------------------------------------
# WorkBuddy 的会话记忆/工作日志，属个人本地数据，不进公共仓库
.workbuddy/
